From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: edk2-cix <edk2-cix@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:48:05 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Platform/CIX/Sky1: AcpiSocTables: add board configuration
 guards

Let boards that use LINUX_ACPI_CONFIG_OVERRIDE adjust SoC DSDT devices
from their LinuxAcpiConfig.h without carrying a copy of the DSDT:

- ACPI_UART01_NO_PINCTRL, ACPI_UART3_DMA, ACPI_UART3_PINCTRL
- ACPI_I2C_FORCE_DISABLE_MASK and ACPI_I2Cn_EXT_CRS
- ACPI_PWM0_STA, ACPI_PWM1_BASE, ACPI_PWM3_PWM5_ENABLE
- ACPI_SPI0_STA, ACPI_SPI1_STA, ACPI_SPI0_NUM_CS
- ACPI_GCRU_STA, ACPI_DCT_ENABLE, ACPI_CGFX_ENABLE
- ACPI_HUBn_EXT_CRS, DP04_EXT_CRS, DP04_EXT_DSD_PROPERTY

Every guard defaults to the existing behaviour, so boards that do not
define them build the same DSDT as before.
---
